            "answer": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_Ya8jqX": {
          "type": "faq",
          "name": "Warranty",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What does the warranty cover?",
            "answer": "<strong>MLToys Ride-On Firetruck Warranty</strong>\n<br>\nWe build our MLToys Ride-On Firetrucks to provide years of fun and dependable use. To give you peace of mind, your MLToys Ride-On Firetruck is covered by a 6-month limited warranty against defects in the manufacturing process, beginning on the date your firetruck is delivered.\n<br><br>\n<strong>What Our Warranty Covers</strong><br>\nIf a part of your MLToys Ride-On Firetruck is found to have a manufacturing defect during the warranty period, MLToys will provide a replacement part at no charge.<br>\nPlease note that this warranty covers the defective component—not replacement of the entire vehicle. In most cases, we will work with you to identify the problem and send the appropriate replacement part so you can get your firetruck back up and running as quickly as possible.\n<br>\n<br>\n<strong>How to Make a Warranty Claim</strong><br>\nIf you believe your MLToys Ride-On Firetruck has a defective part, please email GoFast@MLToys.com with the following information:\n<br>\n<ul>\n<li>Your order number</li>\n<li>A description of the problem</li>\n<li>Clear photos showing the problem or defective part</li>\n<li>Photos of the entire firetruck</li>\n<li>Photos of the tires</li>\n<li>Photos showing the writing/labels on the batteries</li>\n<li>Photos of any customizations or modifications made to the firetruck</li>\n</ul>\nThese photos help our team determine the cause of the problem and make sure we send you the correct replacement part. If it is unclear if a parts failure is due to a defect in manufacturing, or it is possible to repair the part, you may need to mail the part for evaluation or repair.\nPlease do not discard or replace a suspected defective part before contacting us, as we may need additional information or photos to evaluate the warranty claim.\n<br><br>\n<strong>What Isn't Covered</strong><br>\nThe MLToys Ride-On Firetruck warranty covers manufacturing defects under normal use. It does not cover damage or failures resulting from improper use, modifications, accidents, or neglect.\nThe following are not covered under this warranty:\n<br>\n<ul>\n<li>Parts broken or damaged when the vehicle has not been properly broken in according to the included instructions</li>\n<li>Damage caused by exceeding the recommended weight limit</li>\n<li>Damage caused by towing or pulling other objects</li>\n<li>Damage caused by modifications or alterations not authorized by MLToys</li>\n<li>Damage resulting from using the firetruck in competitive racing, racing events, or derbies</li>\n<li>Damage caused by exposure to rain, snow, standing water, or other moisture</li>\n<li>Damage resulting from abuse, misuse, neglect, accidents, or other improper use</li>\n<li>Normal wear and tear or damage resulting from ordinary use</li>\n</ul>\n<br><br>\nOur Goal Is to Get You Back on the Road\nWe know how disappointing it can be when a ride-on toy isn't working the way it should. Our goal is to make the warranty process as simple as possible and get your firetruck back in action quickly.\n<br><br>\nIf you have any questions about your warranty or believe you have a defective part, please contact us at GoFast@MLToys.com. We're happy to help!"
          }
        },
        "faq_hWtkYr": {
          "type": "faq",
          "name": "Contact ML Toys",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I reach ML Toys with a question?",
            "answer": "The best way to contact us is to fill out the form on this page https://www.mltoys.com/pages/contact-us. You can also purchase a video conference with tech support using this same page."
          }
        },
        "faq_fDXiKD": {
          "type": "faq",
          "name": "Return Policy",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is the ML Toys return policy?",
            "answer": "<strong>Firetruck 60 Day Return</strong><br>\nTo be eligible for a return, the product must:\n<br>Be received by MLToys within 14 days of the date your return was approved.\n<br>Be the same product that was originally purchased.\n<br>Include all original accessories and items that were included with the product, including the original box or packaging, manuals, parts, hardware, and any other included items.\n<br>Be returned in its original condition andmust not have been tampered with, used, modified, altered, or otherwise changed.\n<br><br><strong>Returns That Cannot Be Accepted</strong>\n<br>Unfortunately, we cannot accept a return if:\n\n<br>The return was not pre-authorized by MLToys.\n<br>The product is received more than14 days after the return was approved.\n<br>The product is missing the original box, packaging, manuals, parts, accessories, or other items that were originally included.\n<br>The product shows signs of tampering, modification, alteration, or unauthorized repair.\n<br>The product returned is different from the product originally purchased.\n<br><br><em>If a returned product does not meet these requirements, MLToys reserves the right to refuse the return or return the product to the customer.</em>"
          }
        }
      },
